1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,533
Hello everyone, today we are going to try out Dragons Realm

2
00:00:04,533 --> 00:00:07,066
which is a modpack centered around Reika's mods

3
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:11,633
As we spawn, we are welcomed by 8 different books

4
00:00:12,233 --> 00:00:15,233
But we are going to see them in detail later on

5
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:19,733
For the moment, we shall explore this new world

6
00:00:19,733 --> 00:00:22,366
where there are quite a few interesting things

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,433
Such as weird structures that will turn our life into black and white if we get too close by

8
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:32,366
We also have colorful trees with cryptic names

9
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:35,600
And weird crystals on the surface

10
00:00:36,833 --> 00:00:41,166
However, since we could only find frozen biomes in this world

11
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:43,866
we decided to try making a second save

12
00:00:44,433 --> 00:00:48,166
And this time we found out how cool the rivers look in this pack

13
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:54,133
However, in this save we could only find desertic biomes, so let's try again

14
00:00:54,633 --> 00:00:58,266
Third time the charm, we now have a proper spawn

15
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,666
With a beautiful colorful forest close by

16
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:05,333
And we also have both a desert and some snow too

17
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:12,800
So, we pick a place where we can start founding our base and do the usual vanilla things to get started

18
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:18,400
And, once the night comes, we go explore the caves under the surface

19
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:22,266
where we find some quite interesting things

20
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:25,933
Such as weird geysers in random ore clusters

21
00:01:26,433 --> 00:01:30,266
And our exploration was quickly blocked by an uranium vein

22
00:01:31,333 --> 00:01:36,900
Getting close by will hurt us, but, luckily, we will be kept with 1 HP

23
00:01:37,633 --> 00:01:43,900
So, we leave the important stuff behind, take a breath and go try to remove the uranium

24
00:01:44,633 --> 00:01:49,500
After we verify the situation, we take back our equipment and start digging

25
00:01:50,033 --> 00:01:55,433
Once we removed all of the uranium, we deposit it in a place where it will hurt no one

26
00:01:55,733 --> 00:01:57,733
Such as a chest in the middle of our base

27
00:01:58,266 --> 00:02:02,800
We refill our health and hunger bar and then we go back to explore the mine shaft

28
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:08,833
And the first cool thing we find in an unexplored dungeon is, yeah, more uranium

29
00:02:09,433 --> 00:02:11,933
This time, let's try a different route

30
00:02:12,666 --> 00:02:16,000
And we now have found a monolith and a sleepy gas vent

31
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:21,066
Then we find a different poison source, a cave spider spawner

32
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:25,733
Before venturing any further, let's collect some iron to make an armor

33
00:02:25,733 --> 00:02:27,866
Here ores spawn in veins

34
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:32,300
Not as big as Gregtech ones, but not as small as vanilla's

35
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:38,800
With our new armor, we can get rid of the spawner, while also getting high on achievements

36
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:42,900
Behind this annoyance, we find a tin ore vein

37
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:46,300
which puts to use the textures from all the mods in the pack

38
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:52,300
And after more exploration, we have found a third source of poison, gas vents

39
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:57,266
One last thing I'd like to show you is the looks of lava lakes

40
00:02:57,600 --> 00:03:03,800
The lava stone makes them look way cooler, but also even more annoying than Vanilla ones

41
00:03:04,133 --> 00:03:06,866
Anyways, everything looks cool

42
00:03:06,866 --> 00:03:11,800
but our main focus should be to collect some of each material we can manage to find

43
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:18,800
And, once we get home, we get reminded of the good old times, when you had the same ore from different mods

44
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:22,100
And we now have seven different forms of copper

45
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:25,400
I mean, eight different copper ores

46
00:03:25,833 --> 00:03:29,866
Now that we have all that loot, we can smelt down a tiny amount of it

47
00:03:29,866 --> 00:03:31,800
and use that for some ore doubling machine

48
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:35,800
We shall use the good old trusty pulverizer

49
00:03:36,633 --> 00:03:41,666
And we quickly set it up with an even older and trustier BuildCraft engine

50
00:03:41,666 --> 00:03:46,166
This machine will also turn each mineral into a dust of the same mod

51
00:03:46,733 --> 00:03:50,300
Next we make an induction smelter to obtain some invar

52
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:54,566
We need it so that we can make a smeltery to get some good tools

53
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,233
Or so we thought

54
00:03:56,233 --> 00:04:02,300
until we noticed we also need steel for a smeltery that only goes up to 600 degrees

55
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:06,166
So, instead, we go for a paper flint pickaxe

56
00:04:06,166 --> 00:04:10,800
which we empower with a diamond to make it diamond-like but flint repairable

57
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:16,800
This paper tool is now capable of mining obsidian, but it is still too slow and inefficient

58
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:21,633
So we make an obsidian and paper hammer, which we fill with redstone

59
00:04:21,633 --> 00:04:23,800
so that we can gather more obsidian

60
00:04:24,366 --> 00:04:29,800
And, once we have some decent tools, we make a portal and go in the nether

61
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:34,433
At first glance, it looked quite the usual nether

62
00:04:34,433 --> 00:04:39,800
but, after moving a little bit, we started to see that it is quite more annoying than usual

63
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:46,800
And things escalated quite quickly, just look at how intense the effects are in this place

64
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:52,800
Anyways, after a lot of exploration, we have found what we were looking for

65
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:55,800
a nether fortress and some blaze rods

66
00:04:56,300 --> 00:05:00,533
Next, we go visit a magical forest where we hunt a slime king

67
00:05:00,533 --> 00:05:03,800
so that we also get some slime balls

68
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:05,700
And I gotta say

69
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:11,800
just checking out that tree cleaned out my eyes from that hellish place we just run away from

70
00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:19,300
Once we get home, we use our new loot to craft and build a blast furnace, we went with the RailCraft one

71
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:24,800
And it was when we tried to use it, that we found out something was wrong

72
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:31,800
Apparently, both RailCraft and Immersive Engineering blast furnaces require some enriched coal to work

73
00:05:32,300 --> 00:05:36,800
Luckily, we can quickly make it in a BuildCraft assembly table

74
00:05:37,300 --> 00:05:41,800
So, we quickly make one, and also a laser to power it

75
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:46,800
We power it, and, after a bit of time, we get our enriched coal

76
00:05:47,300 --> 00:05:50,800
And that machine just throws stuff on the ground

77
00:05:51,233 --> 00:05:53,300
Now we can finally make some steel

78
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:57,600
We shall use the first ingots to make our first Reika machine

79
00:05:57,600 --> 00:06:00,300
a RotaryCraft blast furnace

80
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:03,800
Now, the temperature on that furnace is quite low

81
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:10,300
To make it go at a usable temperature, we have to place it over a metric cube of hot magma

82
00:06:11,666 --> 00:06:14,500
Once it reaches 600 degrees

83
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:20,300
we can finally use it to make the most used metal of the whole modpack, HSLA steel

84
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:26,300
And our first usage for it shall be a worktable, required to make RF cables

85
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:29,400
Then we make some RF storage cell

86
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:31,800
and we have completed our basic house

87
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:34,800
We are now ready to start using Reika's mod

88
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:37,300
But we shall do that the next episode

89
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,600
Bye bye

90
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,533
大家好 今天我们来试玩一下 Dragons Realm

91
00:00:04,533 --> 00:00:07,066
这是一个以 Reika 的模组为核心的整合包

92
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:11,633
我们一出生 八本不同的书就等待着我们

93
00:00:12,233 --> 00:00:15,233
不过我们之后再细看它们

94
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:19,733
我们先来探索这个新世界

95
00:00:19,733 --> 00:00:22,366
这里有不少有趣的东西

96
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,433
比如一些奇怪的建筑 靠近后会变成没有色彩的人生

97
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:32,366
还有一些名字很神秘的彩色树木

98
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:35,600
地表上还有奇怪的晶体

99
00:00:36,833 --> 00:00:41,166
然而 由于这个世界里只能找到冰雪群系

100
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:43,866
我们决定再开第二个存档试试

101
00:00:44,433 --> 00:00:48,166
这次我们发现 这个整合包里的河流看起来很酷

102
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:54,133
然而 这个存档里只能找到沙漠群系 那我们再试一次

103
00:00:54,633 --> 00:00:58,266
事不过三 我们这次终于有了个像样的出生点

104
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,666
附近还有个美丽的彩色森林

105
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:05,333
而且附近既有沙漠也有雪地

106
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:12,800
于是我们选了一个地方开始建立基地 做了些原版生存起步

107
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:18,400
在夜幕降临后 我们去探索地下洞穴

108
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:22,266
在那里我们发现了一些相当有趣的东西

109
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:25,933
比如随机出现在矿簇里的奇怪喷泉

110
00:01:26,433 --> 00:01:30,266
而我们的探索很快就被一条铀矿脉挡住了

111
00:01:31,333 --> 00:01:36,900
靠近它会受伤 不过幸运的是 我们会至少保留 1 点生命值

112
00:01:37,633 --> 00:01:43,900
于是 我们把重要物品留下 深吸一口气 然后去挖掉那些铀

113
00:01:44,633 --> 00:01:49,500
确认情况安全后 我们拿回装备并开始挖掘

114
00:01:50,033 --> 00:01:55,433
挖完所有铀之后 我们把它存放在一个不会伤害到任何人的地方

115
00:01:55,733 --> 00:01:57,733
比如我们基地正中央的箱子

116
00:01:58,266 --> 00:02:02,800
我们重置生命值和饱食 然后回去继续探索矿井

117
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:08,833
而我们在一个未探索的地牢里找到的第一个好东西是 还是铀

118
00:02:09,433 --> 00:02:11,933
这次我们换条路走

119
00:02:12,666 --> 00:02:16,000
我们找到了巫素柱和催眠气体喷口

120
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:21,066
接着我们找到了另一种毒 一个洞穴蜘蛛刷怪笼

121
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:25,733
在继续深入之前 我们先采些铁来造一套盔甲

122
00:02:25,733 --> 00:02:27,866
在这个包里 铁以矿脉形式生成

123
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:32,300
矿脉没有格雷科技那么大 但也没有原版的那么小

124
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:38,800
有了新盔甲 我们就能清理掉刷怪笼 同时还能收获一堆成就

125
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:42,900
在这个烦人的玩意后面 我们找到了一条锡矿脉

126
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:46,300
整合包里所有模组的材质的锡都有

127
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:52,300
继续探索后 我们又发现了第三种毒 毒气喷口

128
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:57,266
最后 我想给你们看看岩浆湖的样子

129
00:02:57,600 --> 00:03:03,800
熔岩石让它们看起来酷多了 但比原版的也更加烦人

130
00:03:04,133 --> 00:03:06,866
不管怎样 一切看起来都很酷

131
00:03:06,866 --> 00:03:11,800
但我们的主要目标应该是尽可能收集各种材料

132
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:18,800
回到家后 我们回忆起了过去不同模组都有相同矿石的美好时光

133
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:22,100
现在我们有了七种不同形态的铜

134
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:25,400
其实是八种不同的铜矿

135
00:03:25,833 --> 00:03:29,866
既然有了这些战利品 我们可以熔炼一小部分

136
00:03:29,866 --> 00:03:31,800
用来做一些矿物双倍增产的机器

137
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:35,800
我们就用又老又好的研磨机

138
00:03:36,633 --> 00:03:41,666
然后我们迅速用一台更老更好的 BC 引擎来驱动它

139
00:03:41,666 --> 00:03:46,166
这台机器还会把每种矿物变成对应模组的粉

140
00:03:46,733 --> 00:03:50,300
接下来我们制作一台感应炉来获得一些殷钢

141
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:54,566
我们需要它来制造冶炼炉以打造一些好工具

142
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,233
我们本来这么想的

143
00:03:56,233 --> 00:04:02,300
直到我们发现要造一个最高才 600 度的冶炼炉 居然还需要钢

144
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:06,166
于是 我们转而做一把纸燧石镐

145
00:04:06,166 --> 00:04:10,800
我们用钻石强化它 让它具有钻石的性能 但可以用燧石修复

146
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:16,800
这把纸工具现在能挖黑曜石了 但还是太慢太没效率

147
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:21,633
于是我们做了一把黑曜石纸锤 并且给它塞满红石

148
00:04:21,633 --> 00:04:23,800
这样就能收集更多黑曜石

149
00:04:24,366 --> 00:04:29,800
有了像样的工具之后 我们造了个传送门前往下界

150
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:34,433
乍一看 这里跟原版下界没什么区别

151
00:04:34,433 --> 00:04:39,800
但是稍微走动了一下之后 我们发现这里比原版更让人头疼

152
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:46,800
事情很快更加严重 看看这里的画面效果有多哈人

153
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:52,800
不管怎样 经过一番探索后 我们终于找到了要找的东西

154
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:55,800
下界要塞和一些烈焰棒

155
00:04:56,300 --> 00:05:00,533
接下来我们前往魔法森林去猎杀史莱姆王

156
00:05:00,533 --> 00:05:03,800
这样我们也能获得一些黏液球

157
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:05,700
不得不说

158
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:11,800
光是看看那棵树就洗了洗我那刚从地狱般的地方逃离的眼睛

159
00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:19,300
回到家后 我们用新获得的战利品合成并搭建一座 RC 的高炉

160
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:24,800
就在我们尝试使用它的时候 才发现有些不对劲

161
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:31,800
显然 RC 和沉浸工程的高炉都需要一些富集煤才能工作

162
00:05:32,300 --> 00:05:36,800
幸运的是 我们可以在 BC 的装配台里快速制作富集煤

163
00:05:37,300 --> 00:05:41,800
于是我们迅速做了一个 再加个激光器来给它供能

164
00:05:42,300 --> 00:05:46,800
插上电源 过了一段时间后 就得到了富集煤

165
00:05:47,300 --> 00:05:50,800
那个机器直接就把产物扔在地上

166
00:05:51,233 --> 00:05:53,300
现在我们终于可以造钢了

167
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:57,600
我们要用第一批钢锭来制作我们的第一台 Reika 机器

168
00:05:57,600 --> 00:06:00,300
一台旋转工艺高炉

169
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:03,800
不过 这台高炉的温度相当低

170
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:10,300
要让它达到可用温度 我们必须把它放在一立方米的岩浆上面

171
00:06:11,666 --> 00:06:14,500
等它达到 600 度后

172
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:20,300
我们终于可以用它来制作整合包里最常用的金属 HSLA 钢

173
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:26,300
而它的第一个用途是一张制作 RF 线缆必需的工作台

174
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:29,400
然后我们做一些 RF 存储单元

175
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:31,800
我们的基础基地就算完工了

176
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:34,800
我们现在准备好开始玩 Reika 的模组了

177
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:37,300
不过那是下一集的事了

178
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,600
拜拜

